  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNWOMEN - Women Peace and Security in Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Including women in peace and security processes in the region. Finalizing and implementing National Action Plans for Security Council resolution 1325 in several countries in the region. Promoting dialogue among stakeholders on how to involve women.</narrative>
